<div class="p-4">
    <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3" role="tablist">
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabKfList"><i class="bi bi-list-ul me-1"></i>函数列表</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabKfAdd"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i>添加函数</button></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="tab-content">
        <!-- ── 函数列表 ── -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tabKfList">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span>
                        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i>危险内核函数
                        <span class="badge bg-danger ms-2" id="kfStatTotal">-</span>
                        <span class="text-muted small ms-2">
                            (启用:<span id="kfStatEnabled">-</span>
                            / 禁用:<span id="kfStatDisabled">-</span>
                            / 高危:<span id="kfStatHigh">-</span>)
                        </span>
                    </span>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="kfSeverityFilter" style="width:120px" onchange="loadKfList()">
                            <option value="">全部严重度</option>
                            <option value="High">高危</option>
                            <option value="Medium">中危</option>
                            <option value="Low">低危</option>
                        </select>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="kfEnabledFilter" style="width:110px" onchange="loadKfList()">
                            <option value="">全部状态</option>
                            <option value="true">启用</option>
                            <option value="false">禁用</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width:240px">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="kfSearch" placeholder="搜索函数名 / 备注..." onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')loadKfList()">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" onclick="loadKfList()"><i class="bi bi-search"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" onclick="loadKfList()"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i></button>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" onclick="resetKfDefaults()" title="清空所有,恢复默认 4 个"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="table-responsive" style="max-height:65vh;overflow:auto">
                        <table class="table table-hover table-sm mb-0">
                            <thead class="sticky-top bg-white">
                                <tr><th>函数名</th><th>显示名</th><th>分类</th><th>严重度</th><th>状态</th><th>添加时间</th><th>备注</th><th>操作</th></tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="kfTableBody"><tr><td colspan="8" class="text-center text-muted py-4">加载中...</td></tr></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="text-muted small" id="kfPageInfo">-</span>
                    <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="kfPrev" onclick="kfChangePage(-1)"><i class="bi bi-chevron-left"></i></button>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="kfNext" onclick="kfChangePage(1)"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ── 添加函数 ── -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabKfAdd">
            <div class="card" style="max-width:640px">
                <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-2"></i>添加危险内核函数</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        填写内核函数名(精确匹配,大小写敏感)。DriverAttachSelector 扫驱动 IAT 时,
                        如果导入了这里登记的函数,就标记该驱动为高危。
                    </p>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">函数名 *</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="kfAddName" placeholder="如:MmAllocateContiguousMemory">
                        <div class="form-text">只能含字母、数字、下划线。大小写敏感(MmCopyMemory ≠ mmcopymemory)。</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">显示名 (可选)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="kfAddDisplay" placeholder="如:分配连续物理内存">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label">分类</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="kfAddCategory" placeholder="如:内存操作" value="内存操作" list="kfCategoryList">
                            <datalist id="kfCategoryList">
                                <option value="内存操作"></option>
                                <option value="进程操作"></option>
                                <option value="注册表"></option>
                                <option value="对象管理"></option>
                                <option value="文件系统"></option>
                                <option value="其他"></option>
                            </datalist>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label">严重度</label>
                            <select class="form-select" id="kfAddSeverity">
                                <option value="High" selected>高危 — BYOVD 经典 / 反作弊常用</option>
                                <option value="Medium">中危 — 可被滥用但有合法用途</option>
                                <option value="Low">低危 — 需关注但单独出现不构成强信号</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3 form-check">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="kfAddEnabled" checked>
                        <label class="form-check-label" for="kfAddEnabled">启用(参与 IAT 命中判定)</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label">备注 (可选)</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="kfAddNotes" placeholder="如:可被滥用分配物理内存">
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-success btn-sm" id="kfAddBtn" onclick="addKf()">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i>添加
                    </button>
                    <div id="kfAddResult" class="mt-3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/kernel-func-dashboard.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
